  9.     matrix __month_b[1,  3] = _b[1.zlfn#20728.time]
 10.     *** position 4 (aug2018 = 21397) is the baseline = 0 — leave at J() in
> it
.     matrix __month_b[1,  5] = _b[1.zlfn#21428.time]
